      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As long as we're only changing fonts locally (i.e. only visible to you), I wouldn't mind it.\n\nWhat I'm afraid of is letting everyone choose their own publicly visible fonts. Imagine how fast everything would become illegible, and how bad that would be for accessibility lol",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
